BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260824T180000Z
DTEND:20260828T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
SUMMARY:Free Backpack Giveaway Campaign
DESCRIPTION:Free Backpack Giveaway\n\nStart the school year feeling 
 prepared\, confident\, and ready to learn! The Jersey City Free Public 
 Library invites local students and families to register for our Free 
 Backpack Giveaway. Each backpack will include school supplies to help 
 students return to the classroom with both style and comfort.\n\nThis 
 giveaway is about more than supplies. It is about reminding every young 
 person in our community that Jersey City is cheering them on as they begin 
 a new school year filled with possibilities.\n\nWe extend our heartfelt 
 thanks to the Jersey City Free Public Library Foundation for making this 
 special initiative possible and for its continued commitment to supporting 
 Jersey City’s children and families.\n\nRegistration is required. Sign up 
 today to receive a free backpack and school 
 supplies!\n\nhttps://jclibrary.libcal.com/calendar/?t=d&q=backpack&cid=-1&cal=-1&inc=0\n\n
ORGANIZER;CN="Anthony Williams":MAILTO:awilliams@jclibrary.org
CATEGORIES:August
UID:LibCal-20148-17298213
URL:https://jclibrary.libcal.com/event/17298213
END:VEVENT
