SUMMARY:Pages In The Park @ Van Vorst Park Plaza: JCFPL X Reading Rhythms Reading Party!
DESCRIPTION:Reading Rhythms JC and the Jersey City Free Public Library are 
 back with another outdoor reading party collab!\n\n​Come join us for an 
 outdoor reading party at Van Vorst Park to wrap up the summer and support 
 the Jersey City Free Public Library! Library cards are required\, so if you 
 don't have one for Jersey City Free Public library you MUST register for 
 one. The book mobile will be available for folks to sign up for a card! If 
 you are in a different neighborhood\, please bring the library card for 
 that place (for example if you live in Bayonne or Hoboken!).\n\nPLEASE 
 REGISTER VIA THIS LINK: HERE\n\nPlease bring your own snacks/meals to the 
 park! \n\nMore details on the event link as well!
LOCATION:Offsite- please see description 
ORGANIZER;CN="Kevin Ortiz":MAILTO:kortiz@jclibrary.org
