SUMMARY:Repair Cafe 2026 - Fix Your Beloved BUT Broken Items For Free!
DESCRIPTION:Repair Café Garden State offers free\, hands-on help to fix 
 your beloved but broken items with the guidance of skilled Repair Coaches. 
 Services include repairs for bicycles\, clothing\, computers and digital 
 devices\, small electrics\, jewelry\, wooden items\, as well as knife and 
 tool sharpening. Each participant may bring up to two items per person\; 
 gas- or propane-powered items are not accepted.\n\nThe event takes place at 
 the Gym at Grace Church Van Vorst\, 39 Erie Street (between 2nd and 3rd 
 Streets)\, on select Sundays from 1:00 PM to 4:00 PM. Volunteers with time 
 or repair skills are welcome—learn more at repaircafegs.org or call 
 845-741-3646.
LOCATION:Offsite- please see description 
ORGANIZER;CN="Elizabeth Knight":MAILTO:eknight@jclibrary.org
