SUMMARY:FREE Vaccine Clinic!
DESCRIPTION:Join Priscilla Gardner Main Library as they welcome the Jersey 
 City Department of Health and Hudson Regional Health Commission to provide 
 a Free Vaccine Clinic to the residents of Hudson County.\n\nFollowing 
 vaccinations are available:\n\n\n	Flu Vaccine\n	Covid-19 Vaccine (Pfizer or 
 Moderna)\n\n\nBlood pressure and blood sugar screenings will be provided\, 
 as well. \n\nRegistration Required. If bringing a minor (under the age of 
 18) please specify age and what vaccine (Flu or Covid-19) you want them to 
 receive.
LOCATION:PGML Multipurpose Room PGML 415
ORGANIZER;CN="Elizabeth Parker":MAILTO:eparker@jclibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Popular Events > Health and Wellness Events, Popular Events > Older Adults Events
