 quartet through wireless headphones\, bringing every beat\, harmony\, and 
 movement of the strings directly to their ears. It is an intimate\, 
 high-quality listening experience that combines the connection of a live 
 concert with the clarity of your own personal soundtrack.\n\nABOUT THE 
