 galleries\, and studios. Highline has regularly performed at celebrated New 
 York City venues including Joe’s Pub\, SubCulture\, and the Manderley Bar 
 at Sleep No More.\n\nInspired by New York City’s High Line Park\, the 
 ensemble represents the meeting of cultural preservation and contemporary 
 society. Its extensive network includes accomplished musicians with 
 backgrounds from institutions such as Harvard\, Princeton\, Yale\, 
 Dartmouth\, Juilliard\, and the Manhattan School of Music.\n\nAdvance 
