SUMMARY:The Curious Pint #3 -The power of story telling: Featuring Viannca Velez!
DESCRIPTION:The Curious Pint #3: Celebrating Hispanic Heritage Month 
 🎉\n\nJoin us at 902 Brewing (101 Pacific Ave\, Jersey City\, NJ 07304) 
 on Thursday\, October 15th for a special Hispanic Heritage Month edition of 
 The Curious Pint\, featuring guest Viannca Velez to give a talk about the 
 power of story telling! There will also be a Live Bomba/Plena 
 performance.\n\nEvent Schedule:\n\n\n	🕖 7:00 PM — Doors open\n	🎤 
 7:30 PM — Interactive lecture on cultural storytelling (family archives\, 
 oral traditions\, food & song)\n	☕ ~15 min intermission — including 
 library card sign-ups\n	💃 ~30 min — Puerto Rican Folkloric 
 Performance\n	🎶 8:45–9:00 PM — Open engagement with background music 
 (courtesy of 902 Brewing)\n\n\nCome for an evening of connection\, 
 culture\, and community as we honor Hispanic heritage through story and 
 sound!\n\n🎟️ JCFPL Library Card holders that attend will unlock 
 discounted drinks all night! We we’ll have library card sign-ups on site 
 as well!\n\nGet your tickets here: RSVP TODAY 21   EVENT \n\nEvery ticket 
 purchased supports both JCFPL & The Jersey City Free Public Library 
 Foundation and their missions.\n\nBIO for Viannca Velez: \n\nViannca Velez 
 is a Jersey City-based communications strategist and cultural storyteller 
 with 15 years of experience in journalism\, podcasting\, and nonprofit 
 communications. Currently Communications and Narrative Director for 
 Represent Justice\, she's also a practitioner of Afro-Puerto Rican Bomba & 
 Plena\, performing with Segunda Quimbamba\, and founder of Cultura Lovers\, 
 a platform celebrating cultural connection through 
 storytelling.\n\n@vianncavelez \n\n@culturalovers \n\nSegunda Quimbamba 
 will join me for a short performance.  \n\n@segundaquimbamba   
 \n\nwww.segundaquimbamba.org \n\nQuestions? Email Kortiz@jclibrary.org
LOCATION:Offsite- please see description 
ORGANIZER;CN="Kevin Ortiz":MAILTO:kortiz@jclibrary.org
CATEGORIES:October, October > Hispanic Heritage Month (Sep 15 - Oct 15), Popular Events, Popular Events > Music and Dance Events, Popular Events > Social Gatherings
