SUMMARY:JCFPL Presents: Sabor Food Crawl   Latin Food Fair
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Hispanic Heritage Month with JCFPL at our 1st Sabor 
 Food Crawl   Latin Food Fair!\n\nKick off the day with our Sabor Food 
 Crawl\, a ~3-hour stroll through downtown Jersey City to discover local 
 Latin-owned gems. You'll get free samples of some of their best dishes and 
 drinks as we visit 3 restaurants along the way.\n\nRegister HERE\n\nCan't 
 make the crawl? No problem\, join us around 2pm at the Priscilla Gardner 
 Main Library Multipurpose Room for our Latin Food Fair\, featuring 10 
 Latin-owned restaurants selling and sampling their best eats and 
 drinks.\n\nRegister HERE
LOCATION:PGML - Fourth Floor Multipurpose Room
ORGANIZER;CN="Kevin Ortiz":MAILTO:kortiz@jclibrary.org
