SUMMARY:THE SILENT STAGE SERIES: Intro to Salsa Dance
DESCRIPTION:THE SILENT STAGE SERIES: INTRO TO SALSA DANCE WITH KENIA ROSETE 
 DANCE\n\nSaturday\, October 17\, 2026 | 3:00 p.m.\nÀbáké Books & Cafe\n2 
 Webster Avenue\, Jersey City\, NJ\n\nStep onto the dance floor and 
 experience salsa in an entirely new way! Led by Jersey City dancer\, 
 choreographer\, and educator Kenia Rosete\, this welcoming introductory 
 class will guide participants through the rhythm\, movement\, and joyful 
 energy of salsa dance. No previous dance experience is necessary—just 
 bring your enthusiasm and get ready to move!\n\nThis program is part of The 
 Silent Stage Series\, an immersive performance experience from the Jersey 
 City Free Public Library. Participants will wear wireless headphones that 
 deliver the music and instruction directly to them\, creating a clear\, 
 personal connection to every beat while sharing the excitement of dancing 
 together.\n\nABOUT THE INSTRUCTOR\n\nKenia C. Rosete is a Mexican-American 
 dancer\, choreographer\, educator\, and producer based in Jersey City. Her 
 work bridges social and contemporary dance practices while exploring 
 migration\, identity\, and relational movement. She is the founder of Kenia 
 Rosete Dance\, through which she creates original choreographic work\, 
 curates the FOCUS Innovative Choreography Series\, and leads community 
 programs such as The Art of Salsa Dance.\n\nAdvance registration is 
 required. Capacity is limited to only 45 participants\, so reserve your 
 spot early! \n\nREGISTER 
 HERE:https://jerseycityfreepubliclibraryfoundation-bloom.kindful.com/e/intro-to-salsa-the-silent-stage-s…\n\nFour 
 locations. Four performances. One unforgettable listening 
 experience.\n\nHELP BRING MORE EXPERIENCES LIKE THIS TO JERSEY 
 CITY\n\nPrograms like The Silent Stage Series are made possible through 
 community support. By donating to the Jersey City Free Public Library 
 Foundation\, you help the Library bring more innovative\, accessible\, and 
 unforgettable cultural experiences to neighborhoods throughout Jersey 
 City.\n\nEvery contribution—no matter the amount—helps create 
 opportunities for our community to learn\, connect\, and experience 
 something new. Please consider making a donation today and help us keep 
 exciting programs like these coming!
