BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261114T150000Z
DTEND:20261114T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T000000Z
SUMMARY:Local Authors\, Limitless Stories
DESCRIPTION:📚 Local Authors\, Limitless Stories\n\nMark your calendars! 
 Local Authors\, Limitless Stories celebrates our community at the Priscilla 
 Gardner Main Branch Library on Saturday\, Nov. 14th. Meet local 
 self-published authors\, catch a Story Time at 11 AM\, and enjoy two author 
 talks in the afternoon. Free and open to 
 all!\n\n\n	\n		\n			Time\n			Activity\n		\n	\n	\n		\n			10:00 AM – 1:00 
